Z||000025||Max The Chainsaw||12-04-2001||09:32 PM||||Pulled the seats out of my 85 GT to put the Mike's covers on em and found cig lighters, $3.18, some papers and a comdom still packaged. <P>Condom was still good for a couple years yet, musta belonged to the previous owner. If you're reading this, I still got it if ya want it....  LOL<BR>||||reg||1
