Z||000029||Mach10||12-04-2001||09:58 PM||||No, he means "chime codes..." I've noticed the same thing...<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"> the fuse panel flips down?!?????!!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_wtf.gif"><P>The stock fiero auto-shifter has *7* positions... makes ya wonder why they didn' just put in the 4t40 to begin with  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>||||reg||11
